  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      377.76,
      561.96,
      435.83
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitutude is to be acquired by are hereby required toappear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing,before me at 10.00 a.m. on the 09th day of January 2019 atKaduwela Divisional Secretariat.",
