      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      449.76,
      562.13,
      519.83
    ],
    "text": "And further you are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting (in duplicate) on or before the 02nd day of January2019 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars oftheir claims for the compensation for the acquisition of thesaid land/servitude, the amount of compensation and thedetails of the computation of such amount.",
